<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>DEGRADE ME</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">M3SHKA</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">DEGRADE ME</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">3oHa1ezOLtzO3i7e7PBPXv</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">17 Contributors</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Degrade Me Lyrics</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 1]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I shot my wings off and held my tongue</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Uh-huh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I smoke your insults, you blacken my lungs</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Uh-huh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I carved your name into my skin just for fun</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Uh-huh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">To be your</p><p ttm:agent="v1">good boy</p><p ttm:agent="v1">, your number one</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Degrade me to keep me hooked</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'll let you break me 'cause you fuck so good</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'm a masochist for a massive bitch</p><p ttm:agent="v1">The door's wide open, but I won't exit</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Because I'm crazy</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 2]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You're sittin' pretty with your Botox skin</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Uh-huh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You look so proud with that shit eating grin</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Uh-huh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You shoot me down like a bottle of gin</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Uh-huh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ooh that shit gets me, guess I'm fallin' again!</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Degrade me to keep me hooked</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'll let you break me 'cause you fuck so good</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'm a masochist for a massive bitch</p><p ttm:agent="v1">The door's wide open, but I won't exit</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Crazy how I just stay put</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I let you play me like I knew you would</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'm a masochist for a massive bitch</p><p ttm:agent="v1">The door's wide open, but I won't exit</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Because I'm crazy, haha[Guitar Solo]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Bridge]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Crazy, I'm fuckin' crazy)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Degrade me to keep me hooked</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'll let you break me 'cause you fuck so good</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'm a masochist for a massive bitch</p><p ttm:agent="v1">The door's wide open, but I won't exit</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Crazy how I just stay put</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I let you play me like I knew you would</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'm a masochist for a massive bitch</p><p ttm:agent="v1">The door's wide open, but I won't exit</p><p ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I'm crazy</p></div></body></tt>